# catvision（树莓派模块）统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows / 树莓派 diff 噪音
contracts/** text eol=lf
modules/** text eol=lf
mocks/** text eol=lf
pipeline/** text eol=lf
scripts/** text eol=lf
tests/** text eol=lf
requirements/** text eol=lf
models/MANIFEST.json text eol=lf
pyproject.toml text eol=lf
README-catvision.md text eol=lf
*.onnx binary
*.db binary
# 测试图片同样是二进制：不加这两行，tests/** 的 text eol=lf 规则会让 Git
# 对 PNG/JPG 做换行规范化，一旦文件里恰好有 CRLF 就会被改坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
